# Sonames the PocketForge device image provides to the MBHaxe app root (tsp-0qwbh.5).
# Same format as ../build/needed.allow: one "<arch|*> <soname>" per line. app-root.sh adds every
# ELF the app root ships (marblegame, libhl.so.1, the hdlls, lib/*) and runs the gates.sh
# needed-allowlist gate over the top level and lib/ with the result: a NEEDED closure check.
#
# Every package named below is in the image's package closure (image rootfs-packages.txt,
# rootfs-packages-mainline.txt and rootfs-packages-a133-open-7x-gpu.txt plus the gamescope
# session runtime, resolved against the same bookworm snapshot; LOCK.md records the image
# commit). A soname belongs here only if its package is in that closure; anything else is
# bundled through bundle.lock.

# libc6
*        libc.so.6
*        libm.so.6
*        libpthread.so.0
*        libdl.so.2
aarch64  ld-linux-aarch64.so.1
x86_64   ld-linux-x86-64.so.2
# libsdl2-2.0-0
*        libSDL2-2.0.so.0
# libgles2 (GLVND; the vendor or Mesa GLES behind it)
*        libGLESv2.so.2
# zlib1g, libpng16-16
*        libz.so.1
*        libpng16.so.16
# libvorbis0a, libogg0 (libvorbisfile3 depends on them)
*        libvorbis.so.0
*        libogg.so.0
# libasound2, libbsd0 (libsndio7.0 depends on them)
*        libasound.so.2
*        libbsd.so.0
